WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.310
"Wow," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:03.311 --> 00:00:07.916
"I wonder if Robin is Thunderhawk."

3
00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:09.987
She looked over at Detective Smith.

4
00:00:09.988 --> 00:00:13.525
"Detective," Roxy said, "I think—"

5
00:00:13.526 --> 00:00:16.502
The detective's phone rang.

6
00:00:16.503 --> 00:00:21.600
"Hello? Oh no! We'll be right there!"

7
00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:23.790
Detective Smith looked at Roxy.

8
00:00:23.791 --> 00:00:26.473
"Thunderhawk is at Metro City Zoo.

9
00:00:26.474 --> 00:00:29.361
What were you going to tell me?"

10
00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.160
"Never mind," Roxy said.

11
00:00:32.161 --> 00:00:37.111
Zoom! Roxy flew off.

12
00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:41.352
*** When Roxy arrived at the zoo, people were running in every

13
00:00:41.353 --> 00:00:45.010
direction. "There's a big hawk

14
00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:49.474
person!" "Run for your

15
00:00:49.475 --> 00:00:51.235
lives!" Roxy spotted

16
00:00:51.236 --> 00:00:54.579
Thunderhawk. The villain was perched on top of the bird

17
00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.923
building. She had large wings and a hawk

18
00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:01.501
mask. "That's definitely Robin," Roxy

19
00:01:01.502 --> 00:01:04.351
thought. "Thunderhawk!" she

20
00:01:04.352 --> 00:01:06.958
shouted. Robin looked

21
00:01:06.959 --> 00:01:11.226
over. "Go away, Rocket Girl! I'm freeing these

22
00:01:11.227 --> 00:01:14.428
birds!" The villain smashed a hole in the building's

23
00:01:14.429 --> 00:01:17.644
roof. Birds flew

24
00:01:17.645 --> 00:01:21.336
out. "You can't do that!" Roxy

25
00:01:21.337 --> 00:01:24.825
shouted. "Birds shouldn't be in cages!" Robin

26
00:01:24.826 --> 00:01:27.511
cried. "They should be

27
00:01:27.512 --> 00:01:31.795
free!" "You won't be free for much longer, Thunderhawk," Roxy

28
00:01:31.796 --> 00:01:34.208
said. "You're going to

29
00:01:34.209 --> 00:01:36.456
jail!" Roxy shot toward

30
00:01:36.457 --> 00:01:39.141
Robin. She reached out to grab the

31
00:01:39.142 --> 00:01:42.981
villain. Robin leaped. Roxy missed

32
00:01:42.982 --> 00:01:46.748
her. "Hurricane wind!" Robin shouted.

33
00:01:46.749 --> 00:01:49.005
She flapped her huge wings.

34
00:01:49.006 --> 00:01:51.159
Whoo-whoo-whoosh!

35
00:01:51.160 --> 00:01:53.053
A strong wind blew.

36
00:01:53.054 --> 00:01:55.450
Roxy tried to stay where she was.

37
00:01:55.451 --> 00:01:57.785
But the wind was too strong.

38
00:01:57.786 --> 00:02:02.808
Roxy tumbled backward, crashing through the fence of a gorilla exhibit.

39
00:02:02.809 --> 00:02:07.870
"Oof!" Roxy sat up and looked around.

40
00:02:07.871 --> 00:02:10.745
A gorilla looked at her.

41
00:02:10.746 --> 00:02:14.014
Then it jumped out of the exhibit and ran off.

42
00:02:14.015 --> 00:02:16.129
"Uh-oh!" Roxy said.

43
00:02:16.130 --> 00:02:18.839
She already heard people shouting and screaming.

44
00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:20.903
"A gorilla's loose!"

45
00:02:20.904 --> 00:02:25.292
"Run for your lives!"

46
00:02:25.293 --> 00:02:28.109
Roxy crawled out of the exhibit.

47
00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:32.267
Robin swooped over the crowd of screaming people.

48
00:02:32.268 --> 00:02:35.272
"I have to stop Robin," Roxy thought.

49
00:02:35.273 --> 00:02:38.376
"But that gorilla is on the loose!"

50
00:02:38.377 --> 00:02:40.525
Roxy flew after the gorilla.

51
00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:44.010
She saw a zookeeper approaching the animal.

52
00:02:44.011 --> 00:02:46.448
The zookeeper glanced up at Roxy.

53
00:02:46.449 --> 00:02:47.928
"Don't worry, Rocket Girl!

54
00:02:47.929 --> 00:02:50.278
I'll take Melvin back to the gorilla exhibit.

55
00:02:50.279 --> 00:02:54.630
Just stop that villain, please!"

56
00:02:54.631 --> 00:02:56.934
Roxy flew over the zoo.

57
00:02:56.935 --> 00:03:00.027
"Where did Robin go?" she thought.

58
00:03:00.028 --> 00:03:02.100
Then she saw a stampede.

59
00:03:02.101 --> 00:03:08.821
Elephants, rhinos, and other animals were chasing people all over the place!

60
00:03:08.822 --> 00:03:11.342
Roxy heard laughter.

61
00:03:11.343 --> 00:03:13.681
Robin was flying away.

62
00:03:13.682 --> 00:03:21.289
"Good luck catching all those animals, Rocket Girl!"

